<title>FINLAND: STOCKMANN '96 EPS UP 7.1 PCT TO FIM 14.94.</title>
<headline>STOCKMANN '96 EPS UP 7.1 PCT TO FIM 14.94.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		  14.94 vs 13.95</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     316 vs 280</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		    7.50 vs 7.00</p>
<p> Sales						7,420 up 18.7 pct</p>
<p> Turnover					   6,165 vs 5,214</p>
<p> Operating profit				   291 vs 249</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	 404 vs 340</p>
<p> Depreciation on fixed assets		   112 vs 92</p>
<p> Net financial items			  gain 25 vs 32 gain</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			 gain 0.1 vs 1.3 gain</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	  316 vs 282</p>
<p> Increase in accel. depreciation	charge 61 vs 70 charge</p>
<p> Decrease in volutary appropriations    gain 60 vs 60 gain</p>
<p> Taxes for previous periods			98 vs 79</p>
<p> Net profit					   218 vs 193</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    58.8 vs 63.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish department store company is Oy</p>
<p>Stockmann Ab.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
